  ('fabrication', 'Sheet Metal Fabrication & Welding', 'Dedicated MS, SS & Al welding stations with clamps and fixtures, plus grinding, buffing and cleaning.', '/sites/pslaser/gallery/fabrication-welding-bg.jpg', 5),
